2213
02:56:56,731 --> 02:57:00,789
They did not go home. That was the first
thing the humans noticed.

2214
02:57:01,357 --> 02:57:06,853
Tan Wei Lin noticed it in her second week, when she
came in at five in the morning to

2215
02:57:06,873 --> 02:57:12,368
