2236
02:58:38,572 --> 02:58:38,955
sheet.

2237
02:58:40,275 --> 02:58:41,329
Ten draws.

2238
02:58:48,140 --> 02:58:49,237
Results.

2239
02:58:59,195 --> 02:59:00,027
Jet lag.

2240
02:59:00,547 --> 02:59:02,426
Fate is mocking you.

2241
02:59:02,946 --> 02:59:08,737
Fate has just made me the only chief executive in
