2252
03:00:02,535 --> 03:00:05,474
window before it reached the
edge and vanished.

2253
03:00:06,045 --> 03:00:11,396
He watched it for what felt like a minute. He
thought about the recruitment list, and

2254
03:00:11,416 --> 03:00:16,956
the Arklay budget, and a woman in Manhattan who knew
