3728
05:03:36,287 --> 05:03:37,353
I want to meet it.

3729
05:03:40,004 --> 05:03:44,987
Assessment. Biological asset,
field validated.

3730
05:03:46,963 --> 05:03:52,630
In the desert, four levels down, the cradle closed
