3768
05:07:21,561 --> 05:07:24,180
The French contribution was the Russians.

3769
05:07:24,750 --> 05:07:30,020
The General Directorate for External Security had
been watching a particular group of

3770
05:07:30,040 --> 05:07:35,745
former Russian special forces soldiers for years,
because they had worked in French-speaking

3771
05:07:35,765 --> 05:07:41,160
