3803
05:10:13,482 --> 05:10:19,471
Umbrella's number was two billion pounds — a new
research campus on the Cambridge site,

3804
05:10:19,491 --> 05:10:25,411
seventeen hundred jobs. It was announced at
eight-fifteen. At eight-sixteen, the Prime

3805
05:10:25,431 --> 05:10:31,765
Minister shook the Director's hand for the cameras, and
