3845
05:13:35,372 --> 05:13:40,989
He smiled, and bowed his head very slightly, and was
gone into the crowd before she could

3846
05:13:41,009 --> 05:13:41,433
answer.

3847
05:13:43,002 --> 05:13:47,991
She should have given the card to the Director. She
told herself, on the flight home,

3848
05:13:48,011 --> 05:13:50,406
that she had meant to, and had forgotten.

3849
05:13:50,977 --> 05:13:56,501
She put it in her wallet, behind her own business
