3893
05:17:25,880 --> 05:17:27,246
They are gathering.

3894
05:17:27,766 --> 05:17:30,001
They're noticing. That isn't
the same thing.

3895
05:17:30,521 --> 05:17:36,709
It is how it starts. I told you. Two people in a
room. Then five. Then nations.

3896
05:17:38,230 --> 05:17:41,321
Then let's give the nations something
else to think about.

3897
05:17:43,341 --> 05:17:49,185
He did not say what he meant. The Adolf half of the
mind did not ask. It was still quiet,

3898
05:17:49,205 --> 05:17:52,612
the way it had been at the window
in Downing Street.

3899
05:17:53,182 --> 05:17:59,233
But on the table in the Memory Palace, in a room on
the fourth floor with no name on the

3900
05:18:16,698 --> 05:18:22,682
By the spring of twenty thirty-one, Owen Carrick had
become the thing that every institution

3901
05:18:22,702 --> 05:18:28,491
fears most in one of its own: a man who is right, and
cannot prove it, and will not stop.

3902
05:18:29,060 --> 05:18:34,929
He did the hazmat drills. He gave the chemistry
lectures. He handled the man in Scranton,

3903
05:18:34,949 --> 05:18:40,752
who had moved on to trying to buy fentanyl precursors
