4834
06:37:59,142 --> 06:38:02,357
They wanted to know where the
Director's blood was kept.

4835
06:38:04,928 --> 06:38:08,095
Wen Shulan had been watching him
for three years.

4836
06:38:08,665 --> 06:38:14,696
She had watched the eleven seconds, and the ghost
video, and the Court of Chancery, where

4837
06:38:14,716 --> 06:38:20,680
he had taken off his sunglasses and shown a courtroom
a pair of perfectly ordinary eyes.

4838
06:38:20,701 --> 06:38:26,460
She had read Owen Carrick's affidavit, and Exhibit
Twenty, and footnote fourteen. She

4839
06:38:26,481 --> 06:38:32,240
had read the German patent analysis and the French
report on the twelve Russians. And

4840
06:38:32,261 --> 06:38:38,156
she had read, from the Ministry's own sources in
Moscow, a copy of an order that an FSB

4841
06:38:38,177 --> 06:38:44,005
colonel named Arkady Belov had given in January of
twenty thirty-one. Find out what he

4842
06:38:44,025 --> 06:38:47,812
is. And when you have found out, tell
me how to kill it.

4843
06:38:48,382 --> 06:38:53,841
Wen did not want to kill it. She was not a
sentimental woman, and she did not believe

4844
06:38:53,861 --> 06:38:59,319
in revenge. She believed in advantage. And she had
concluded, after three years, that

4845
06:38:59,339 --> 06:39:04,927
whatever made Albert Wesker what he was — whatever
let him move at three hundred metres

4846
06:39:04,947 --> 06:39:10,534
a second, and choose the colour of his own eyes, and
file patents with no parents — was

4847
06:39:10,554 --> 06:39:12,725
in him. In his body. In his blood.

4848
06:39:13,415 --> 06:39:18,689
If we cannot buy the company, and we cannot copy the
company, then we take the source.

4849
06:39:21,209 --> 06:39:27,124
The Director went to Hong Kong in May, for a
medical conference at which Umbrella was

4850
06:39:27,144 --> 06:39:33,058
the principal sponsor. He knew what was waiting for
him. The nine radios in Singapore

4851
06:39:33,078 --> 06:39:37,945
had told him, three weeks before, exactly
what Beijing had asked them.

4852
06:39:38,636 --> 06:39:43,285
You are walking into their city. Into
their net. With two guards.

4853
06:39:43,804 --> 06:39:48,921
I'm walking into a conference, with two guards and a
keynote. And I'd like to meet the

4854
06:39:48,941 --> 06:39:53,998
woman who's been watching me for three years. She's
the only one of them who's clever

4855
06:39:54,018 --> 06:39:55,491
enough to be interesting.

4856
06:39:56,012 --> 06:39:58,083
And if she tries to take you?

4857
06:39:58,602 --> 06:40:03,710
Then I'll learn something about Chinese
intelligence. And she'll learn something about

4858
06:40:03,730 --> 06:40:03,888
me.

4859
06:40:05,910 --> 06:40:07,714
They tried on the second night.

4860
06:40:08,284 --> 06:40:14,815
It was very well done. The Director would say so
