5539
07:38:22,603 --> 07:38:26,128
He felt her decide, from four
hundred metres above.

5540
07:38:26,699 --> 07:38:32,367
That was what Banner-Sense did. It had been three
years, and he had learned to read it

5541
07:38:32,387 --> 07:38:38,187
the way a sailor reads water. A hundred and forty
thousand people below him in the dark,

5542
07:38:38,207 --> 07:38:44,471
each one a small steady light — and one of them, in a
hotel on the second ring, was flickering.

5543
07:38:45,040 --> 07:38:48,464
He could have stopped it. It would have
taken a telephone call.

5544
07:38:50,655 --> 07:38:52,000
End it tonight.

5545
07:38:52,521 --> 07:38:53,141
No.

5546
07:38:53,660 --> 07:38:59,779
She is going to destroy you. Not for money. Not for a
rival. For conscience. That is the

5547
07:38:59,799 --> 07:39:02,360
only kind that cannot be bought back.

5548
07:39:02,880 --> 07:39:08,097
I know exactly what she's going to do. She's going to
tell Julian Ashcombe that the money

5549
07:39:08,117 --> 07:39:13,157
is the wrong picture, and Julian Ashcombe is going
to start looking at the people, and

5550
07:39:13,177 --> 07:39:18,218
in about four years he is going to arrive at the
truth, and then he is going to try to

5551
07:39:18,238 --> 07:39:18,689
