5556
07:39:38,750 --> 07:39:42,314
That is not a reason. That is boredom.

5557
07:39:43,834 --> 07:39:44,468
Yes.

5558
07:39:46,988 --> 07:39:52,136
It was the most honest thing he had said in nine
