5559
07:39:54,707 --> 07:39:59,795
And there was one more thing on Arklay, which
was not in any of the brochures.

5560
07:40:00,364 --> 07:40:06,398
The Umbrella Security Service had existed since
twenty thirty. For most of its life it

5561
07:40:06,418 --> 07:40:12,591
