officers in blazers.

5563
07:40:17,032 --> 07:40:23,102
On Arklay it became something else, because on
Arklay there was no other police force,

5564
07:40:23,122 --> 07:40:29,192
and no other coastguard, and no other port
authority. By twenty thirty-nine the U.S.S.

5565
07:40:29,212 --> 07:40:35,423
