5573
07:41:14,734 --> 07:41:19,197
Assessment. Territory.
Sovereign in practice.

5574
07:41:24,574 --> 07:41:28,079
Territory. Not facility. Not
asset. Territory.

5575
07:41:28,650 --> 07:41:34,624
It was the first time the System had used that word
since a diner in Wilmington, in twenty

5576
07:41:34,644 --> 07:41:40,353
twenty-six, when a landlord had signed away a
four-storey brick building for two point

5577
07:41:40,373 --> 07:41:41,752
