5676
07:50:25,834 --> 07:50:27,077
The quiet ones.

5677
07:50:29,646 --> 07:50:35,808
Catherine Adeyemi spent three weeks a year on Arklay
after twenty thirty-nine, and hated

5678
07:50:35,828 --> 07:50:41,709
