5693
07:52:01,134 --> 07:52:06,729
on Arklay that could hurt him and because the
Banner-Sense worked better outdoors.

5694
07:52:07,299 --> 07:52:12,642
A hundred and sixty thousand small steady lights. He
could feel them all. A teacher on

5695
07:52:12,662 --> 07:52:18,317
the Third Ring who had fallen asleep marking. A
sergeant on the Fourth doing a night patrol

5696
07:52:18,337 --> 07:52:23,618
and thinking about his son. Four thousand quiet
ones who burned with a light that was

5697
07:52:23,638 --> 07:52:28,918
not light at all, but something more like a wire.
And two hundred metres down, in the

5698
07:52:28,938 --> 07:52:34,095
