5700
07:52:42,011 --> 07:52:42,694
I know.

5701
07:52:43,214 --> 07:52:48,975
I could not build it. I had the crowds and the
banners and a continent, and I could not

5702
07:52:48,995 --> 07:52:51,898
build one street like this. Do
you know why?

5703
07:52:53,419 --> 07:52:56,279
Because you gave them an enemy
instead of a roof.

5704
07:52:56,799 --> 07:52:57,764
Yes.

5705
07:52:59,664 --> 07:53:05,420
I gave them someone to hate, because hate is quick,
and I was in a hurry, and I thought

5706
07:53:05,440 --> 07:53:11,064
a people could be held together by what it was
against. And it held. For eight years,

5707
07:53:11,084 --> 07:53:16,177
it held beautifully, and then it burned, and
