5752
07:57:31,694 --> 07:57:38,184
It was an agreement between Umbrella Life Sciences and
the canton of Basel-Stadt, negotiated

5753
07:57:38,204 --> 07:57:44,624
over two years, and it was, on its face, a perfectly
