5773
07:59:29,708 --> 07:59:30,718
A vote.

5774
07:59:31,240 --> 07:59:31,944
A vote.

5775
07:59:32,465 --> 07:59:38,164
I took a country with a vote. They have never
forgiven me for it, and they have spent

5776
07:59:38,184 --> 07:59:41,192
