5799
08:01:33,463 --> 08:01:35,996
I know, Owen. I've held one.

5800
08:01:38,016 --> 08:01:39,020
Then why?

5801
08:01:41,040 --> 08:01:45,463
Because in seventeen years he has never once been
surprised in public. Everything the

5802
08:01:45,483 --> 08:01:50,012
world knows about him, he has arranged. If we cannot
