5809
08:02:21,009 --> 08:02:26,861
The Director signed at ten eighteen. He stood up. He
shook the hand of the President of

5810
08:02:26,881 --> 08:02:30,439
the Cantonal Executive. He turned
to face the square.

5811
08:02:34,509 --> 08:02:40,240
The narrator will not tell you what was in the van,
or how it came to be there, or who

5812
08:02:40,260 --> 08:02:45,992
