5844
08:05:24,718 --> 08:05:27,886
It is difficult, now, to explain
what that did.

5845
08:05:28,455 --> 08:05:34,368
Thirteen billion views in four days — the largest
single event in the history of human

5846
08:05:34,388 --> 08:05:40,231
attention. It was watched more than the Moon
