5861
08:06:50,729 --> 08:06:52,672
Catherine Adeyemi had known.

5862
08:06:53,242 --> 08:06:58,633
Not the detail. Not the date, or the van, or the
woman from the quarry office. She had

5863
08:06:58,653 --> 08:07:04,421
known, from one sentence in one call, that Julian
