5867
08:07:19,964 --> 08:07:22,030
She found out at fourteen eighteen.

5868
08:07:24,099 --> 08:07:29,855
He was waiting for her in the suite. He had not
changed his coat. It was on the back of

5869
08:07:29,875 --> 08:07:33,307
