5947
08:14:01,430 --> 08:14:08,365
Lantern spent two years doing what such organisations
do. It mapped. It watched. It compiled.

5948
08:14:08,936 --> 08:14:14,939
It established that Umbrella Life Sciences had, by
twenty forty-four: four hundred and

5949
08:14:14,959 --> 08:14:21,032
eighty thousand direct employees; a market value
larger than the combined stock markets

5950
08:14:21,052 --> 08:14:27,126
of Germany and Japan; the sole manufacturing
capacity for eight medicines without which

5951
08:14:27,146 --> 08:14:33,360
the health systems of forty countries would fail
within a month; a private security force

5952
08:14:33,380 --> 08:14:39,593
of nineteen thousand with its own naval and air
assets; a sovereign-in-practice territory

5953
08:14:39,613 --> 08:14:45,687
in the Atlantic with a hundred and sixty thousand
residents; controlling influence over

5954
08:14:45,707 --> 08:14:51,710
the regulatory regime of the world's pharmaceutical
