5955
08:14:51,730 --> 08:14:58,014
the defence establishments of nine nations; and a
joint research venture with the People's

5956
08:14:58,034 --> 08:14:59,275
Republic of China.

5957
08:14:59,844 --> 08:15:05,655
It established that there were, somewhere,
laboratories that did not appear in any filing.

5958
08:15:05,675 --> 08:15:07,535
It could not establish where.

5959
08:15:08,104 --> 08:15:14,242
And it established, from four separate sources over
two years, that Umbrella possessed

5960
08:15:14,262 --> 08:15:20,543
at least one and possibly several biological assets
of a kind that had no precedent, and

5961
08:15:20,563 --> 08:15:25,626
which two of the sources described,
independently, using the same word.

5962
08:15:26,197 --> 08:15:27,030
Tyrant.

5963
08:15:29,600 --> 08:15:34,457
The raid was authorised by three governments
and executed by none of them.

5964
08:15:35,026 --> 08:15:40,855
It was, on paper, a warrant. A federal magistrate
in Nevada, presented with two years

5965
08:15:40,875 --> 08:15:46,909
of Lantern's work by a Justice Department that had
been fighting internally about it for

5966
08:15:46,929 --> 08:15:52,826
sixteen months, signed a search warrant for the
Ashford Pacific data centre at four in

5967
08:15:52,846 --> 08:15:56,404
the morning on the third of June,
twenty forty-four.

5968
08:15:56,973 --> 08:16:03,187
It was served by two hundred and forty people: an
FBI Hostage Rescue Team, a Department

5969
08:16:03,207 --> 08:16:09,778
of Energy nuclear emergency support team, a CDC
containment unit, and — under an arrangement

5970
08:16:09,798 --> 08:16:16,012
that thirteen lawyers had spent four months
