5981
08:17:02,750 --> 08:17:08,716
They went down four levels. They found servers, and
cooling plants, and empty concrete

5982
08:17:08,736 --> 08:17:14,634
rooms. They found a fourth level with bolt holes in
the floor in a rectangle six feet

5983
08:17:14,654 --> 08:17:17,000
by six, and a faint smell of cold.

5984
08:17:17,570 --> 08:17:19,445
They found nothing else at all.

5985
08:17:20,016 --> 08:17:26,241
Umbrella had known about the warrant for nine days,
because a deputy assistant attorney

5986
08:17:26,261 --> 08:17:32,343
general had told a lobbyist, who had told a man on
Umbrella's advisory board, who had

5987
08:17:32,363 --> 08:17:33,061
told Pell.

5988
08:17:35,630 --> 08:17:41,809
What happened at fourteen minutes past six has been
the subject of four national inquiries

5989
08:17:41,829 --> 08:17:48,077
and one international one, and none of them has ever
established, to anyone's satisfaction,

5990
08:17:48,097 --> 08:17:49,179
who fired first.

5991
08:17:49,748 --> 08:17:56,242
There were two hundred and forty federal personnel on
the site. There were, at the perimeter,

5992
08:17:56,262 --> 08:18:02,406
nineteen Umbrella Security Service officers who had
been instructed by Hale, in writing,

5993
08:18:02,426 --> 08:18:05,838
to render every assistance and to
remain unarmed.

5994
08:18:06,408 --> 08:18:12,097
And on the access road, arriving twelve minutes
after the raid began, was a convoy of

5995
08:18:12,117 --> 08:18:17,806
four Umbrella vehicles that no one at Lantern had
known about, carrying an asset that

5996
08:18:17,826 --> 08:18:23,986
had been moved out of the desert complex six days
before and was being brought back, because

5997
08:18:24,006 --> 08:18:28,084
the Director had decided that the world
was ready to see one.

5998
08:18:30,154 --> 08:18:36,723
The firing lasted nineteen seconds. Two federal agents
were wounded, one seriously. Eleven

5999
08:18:36,743 --> 08:18:43,021
Umbrella officers were killed, all of them from the
Shop, all of them standing exactly

6000
08:18:43,041 --> 08:18:46,974
where they had been told to stand,
none of them armed.

6001
08:18:47,545 --> 08:18:50,253
And then the door of the second
vehicle opened.

6002
08:18:54,324 --> 08:18:59,850
The footage from the news helicopter is four minutes
and eleven seconds long, and it is

6003
08:18:59,870 --> 08:19:03,612
the most-watched video in the history
of the human species.

6004
08:19:04,182 --> 08:19:10,491
It shows a nine-foot grey figure stepping down out of
an armoured transport in the Mojave

6005
08:19:10,511 --> 08:19:16,678
Desert at dawn, in front of two hundred and forty
federal officers, on live television,

6006
08:19:16,698 --> 08:19:17,389
in colour.

6007
08:19:17,961 --> 08:19:23,316
It does not attack. That is the thing that every
commentator for the next twenty years

6008
08:19:23,336 --> 08:19:28,816
would come back to. It steps down, and it stands, and
it looks at them — two hundred and

6009
08:19:28,836 --> 08:19:32,192
forty people with rifles — and it
does nothing at all.

6010
08:19:34,760 --> 08:19:41,015
And then a man in a black coat walks out of the dust
behind it, past its right hand, toward

6011
08:19:41,035 --> 08:19:46,876
the federal line, with his hands open and visible,
and stops, and says — to a Hostage

6012
08:19:46,896 --> 08:19:52,806
Rescue Team commander who has aimed at a great many
things in his career and has never

6013
08:19:52,826 --> 08:19:54,944
in his life been so frightened:

6014
08:19:55,633 --> 08:19:59,874
Lower your weapons. Nobody else needs to
die in a car park today.

6015
08:20:01,775 --> 08:20:08,034
My name is Albert Wesker. This is a biological
containment asset, developed under contract

6016
08:20:08,054 --> 08:20:14,383
to the Department of Defense. I have the contract
numbers. I have the clearance. And eleven

6017
08:20:14,403 --> 08:20:17,523
of my unarmed officers are dead
on that road.

6018
08:20:18,922 --> 08:20:21,032
Now. Shall we continue the inspection?

6019
08:20:24,552 --> 08:20:26,592
The world did not sleep for a week.

6020
08:20:27,161 --> 08:20:33,208
The thing in the Mojave had a name within nine
hours, because Umbrella gave it one. Not

6021
08:20:33,228 --> 08:20:39,275
Tyrant. Umbrella's statement — released at nine that
morning, before any government had

6022
08:20:39,295 --> 08:20:45,620
said anything at all — described it as a Class Four
Biological Containment Asset, developed

6023
08:20:45,640 --> 08:20:51,896
under classified contract for the United States
Department of Defense, designed to operate

6024
08:20:51,916 --> 08:20:54,894
in environments lethal to
human responders.

6025
08:20:55,465 --> 08:21:01,421
The Pentagon confirmed the contract that afternoon,
because the contract was real, and

6026
08:21:01,441 --> 08:21:07,465
because Martin Sloane, now sixty-eight and three
years from retirement, had spent seven

6027
08:21:07,485 --> 08:21:10,869
hours on the telephone making
sure that it would.

6028
08:21:11,440 --> 08:21:16,911
What followed was not a scandal about Umbrella. It
was a scandal about the government.

6029
08:21:17,480 --> 08:21:23,890
For six weeks, the story was that the Department of
Defense had secretly funded the development

6030
08:21:23,910 --> 08:21:29,778
of engineered biological soldiers, had lied to
Congress about it, and had then sent two

6031
08:21:29,798 --> 08:21:35,666
hundred and forty federal officers to raid the
facility of the contractor it had itself

6032
08:21:35,686 --> 08:21:41,555
commissioned, killing eleven unarmed men. Two
committee chairs demanded the Secretary's

6033
08:21:41,575 --> 08:21:47,510
resignation. The Justice Department opened an
investigation into the leak that had given

6034
08:21:47,530 --> 08:21:53,331
Umbrella nine days' warning, and found the lobbyist,
and the deputy assistant attorney

6035
08:21:53,351 --> 08:21:57,865
general, and the story became, for another
three weeks, about that.

6036
08:21:58,435 --> 08:22:04,482
Joint Task Force Lantern was not disbanded. It was
worse than disbanded. Two of its six

6037
08:22:04,502 --> 08:22:10,409
member states withdrew. The remaining four were
instructed, by their own governments,

6038
08:22:10,429 --> 08:22:14,313
