6991
09:46:14,093 --> 09:46:16,901
Beyond. Access expanded.

6992
09:46:19,991 --> 09:46:21,893
The greyed-out lines resolved.

6993
09:46:22,463 --> 09:46:28,260
He read them, standing at the window, with the Earth
turning below and the stars going

6994
09:46:28,280 --> 09:46:34,279
past. And for the first time since a washroom in the
rain in September twenty twenty-six,

6995
09:46:52,224 --> 09:46:58,044
Catherine Adeyemi refused the therapy in twenty
forty-nine, and again in fifty-four, and

6996
09:46:58,064 --> 09:47:03,685
again in sixty-one, and the last time they
discussed it she was seventy-three and she

6997
09:47:03,705 --> 09:47:09,525
put her hand on his arm, which she had never done in
