The one I've never asked.

7039
09:50:16,769 --> 09:50:17,409
Yes.

7040
09:50:17,929 --> 09:50:22,624
In twenty twenty-eight you told me there was a
facility under the old building. You told

7041
09:50:22,644 --> 09:50:27,338
