7049
09:50:49,547 --> 09:50:50,187
Yes.

7050
09:50:52,207 --> 09:50:53,394
Thank you.

7051
09:50:55,914 --> 09:51:01,911
She died four days later, in the afternoon, in the
chair by the window, with a book she

7052
09:51:01,931 --> 09:51:03,295
