not quite constant.

7112
09:56:23,272 --> 09:56:29,580
Every single element of it was a negotiating position.
He recognised the technique perfectly.

7113
09:56:29,600 --> 09:56:33,117
He had once made a landlord walk
through a basement.

7114
09:56:35,188 --> 09:56:40,799
The being that spoke for the Tollhouse Compact was
called — as near as the translation

7115
09:56:40,819 --> 09:56:46,364
